**Akış:** brief oku → brand check → design create/edit → spec resize → export → registry güncelle (`CANVA_OPS/DESIGN_REGISTRY.csv`).

**MCP:** `.cursor/mcp.json` → `https://mcp.canva.com/mcp`

**Skills:** `canva-edit-design`, `canva-export-pipeline`, `canva-production-pipeline`

**OAuth:** `tools/canva-client/` — PKCE henüz TODO; keys Cursor Secrets'ta.

BRIEF-ONLY modda Canva tool çağırma; yalnızca brief/spec çıktısı üret.
